n\nFor Sale (225)For Rent (52)\n\n* * *\n\n## About Damansara City Residency (DC Residensi)\n\nDamansara City Residency services apartment is part of the Damansara City project located at Pusat Bandar Damansara, Damansara Heights. This property is developed by GuocoLand (Malaysia) Berhad which have five decades of experience as a master township planner.\nThere are four elevators and 1 service lift in each residential tower. There are 10 types of units in this property. Type A1, A2 and A3 units are 1+1 bedroom units, 1160 sq ft, 1148 sq ft and 1187 sq ft respectively. Type B1 units are 2+1 bedroom unit, while B2 and B3 are 2+1+1 bedroom units, sized 1668 sq ft, 1855 sq ft and 1857 sq ft respectively. Type C1 units are bigger, 2079 sq ft and consist of 3+1 bedrooms. Type E1 units are executive units, which consists of 3+1 bedrooms and size 2705 sq ft. Not to forget penthouse units. There are single-storey penthouse and duplex penthouse available in this property. Both the penthouse units are 4+1 bedrooms, at 3074 sq ft and 4676 sq ft respectively.\nDamansara City Residency uses the finest materials to build. Each unit has Turkish Marble on the floor, and Solid Wood American oak is the flooring for all the bedrooms. Every unit also equipped with the plaster ceiling, air-conditioning and water heater too. For its built-in kitchen cabinets, there is Poggen Pohl from Germany, German brand Miele for its kitchen appliances and oven, bathroom sanitary fittings from Italian brands Gessi Emporio, and CATALANO. The property also offers Smart Home Technology for the convenience of residents and provide a better quality of life.\nThis property is a completed project. The selling price starts from RM 1.7 million while the maintenance fee is RM0.33 per square feet for the first year.\nThe recent projects developed by GuocoLand (Malaysia) Berhad are Palmera, Pantai Sepang Putra; 3 Kia Peng and Amandarii bungalows in Kajang. The other projects in the area are One Menerung, Twins and